        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "had a great experience shopping at urban planet vaudreuil. although it was really crowded staff and cashier were welcoming and moving at a fast pace. nice clothing for good prices",
        "time": 1766810642,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "micheline ammar",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106563667920925969792/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqzzdTNUQ7EKrIG63lXsPvaqLwh6zigBsyz8wsEkzRPAGP0Ybo=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Customer service was very disappointing. I was buying gift cards and they couldn't provide me with individual recipes. On top of it they were rude and annoyed with me. I think they forgot that I was the customer. I will not come back to this store.",
        "time": 1766533565,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "QT K8",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113203033041578491560/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjXNh309jhFilb5vesxgkbgASxHzesR_DsFlVoCorYmPOoGaec=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The employees are not very smiley or look happy to be there especially at the cash. It’s my favourite place to buy clothes from.",
        "time": 1761399594,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Caillan Macdonald-Kidd",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104769156512263949661/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpu29t6VGNlYsN3aGeAmpQ3KOaUTdMzYfPS0Mvwzb2v3YrltzPBw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Love the store and the prices, but i can never find someone who works there to help reach for items too high. I had to chase down someone to help after looking for someone for over a half hour.",
        "time": 1752505749,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Neigbor Bestie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114772497360090847078/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBMn7TsWsvz97spElO1CzxkLxUNwWVFUfJcByPCbRlAdKL_fA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I love Urban but the Staff in Vaudreuil is often a little rude and arrogant. Also, lots of the items that are offered online are not in store . There’s \"SALE\" poster upfront but sometimes it doesn’t make a big difference on price . Please bring back jewelry and friendlier staff !",
